msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"El código de esta página fue desarrollado con los siguientes requisitos.\n"
"Recomendamos usar estas versiones o versiones más recientes.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless está siendo actualizado y sus funciones están cambiando rápidamente.** Durante esta fase de desarrollo, consulta las notas de versión y la documentación más reciente en la página de [Qiskit Serverless en GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example demonstrates how to use `qiskit-serverless` tools to create a "
"parallel transpilation program, and then implement `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to "
"upload your program to IBM Quantum Platform to use as a reusable remote "
"service.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este ejemplo demuestra cómo usar las herramientas de `qiskit-serverless` "
"para crear un programa de transpilación en paralelo, y luego implementar "
"`qiskit-ibm-catalog` para subir tu programa a IBM Quantum Platform y usarlo "
"como un servicio remoto reutilizable.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow overview {#workflow-overview}"
msgstr "Descripción general del flujo de trabajo {#workflow-overview}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a local directory and empty program file "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea un directorio local y un archivo de programa vacío "
"(`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add code to your program that, when uploaded to Qiskit Serverless, will "
"transpile a circuit\n"
msgstr ""
"Agrega código a tu programa que, cuando se suba a Qiskit Serverless, "
"transpilará un circuito\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Usa `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para autenticarte en Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the program to Qiskit Serverless\n"
msgstr "Sube el programa a Qiskit Serverless\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After uploading your program , you can run it to transpile the circuit by "
"following the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload "
"remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload) guide.\n"
msgstr ""
"Después de subir tu programa, puedes ejecutarlo para transpilar el circuito "
"siguiendo la guía [Ejecuta tu primera carga de trabajo de Qiskit Serverless "
"de forma remota](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Example: Remote transpilation with Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-"
"transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr ""
"Ejemplo: Transpilación remota con Qiskit Serverless {#example-remote-"
"transpilation-with-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This example walks you through creating and adding to a program file that, "
"when you upload it to Qiskit Serverless, will transpile a `circuit` against "
"a given `backend` and target `optimization_level`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Este ejemplo te guía por el proceso de crear y completar un archivo de "
"programa que, cuando lo subas a Qiskit Serverless, transpilará un `circuit` "
"contra un `backend` dado y un `optimization_level` objetivo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"tip\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Serverless requires setting up your workload’s `.py` files into a "
"dedicated directory. The following structure is an example of good "
"practice:\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit Serverless requiere organizar los archivos `.py` de tu carga de "
"trabajo en un directorio dedicado. La siguiente estructura es un ejemplo de "
"buenas prácticas:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr "</DoqAdmonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Serverless uploads the contents of a specific directory (in this example, "
"the `source_files` directory) to run remotely. After these are set up, you "
"can adjust `transpile_remote.py` to fetch inputs and return outputs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Serverless sube el contenido de un directorio específico (en este ejemplo, "
"el directorio `source_files`) para ejecutarlo de forma remota. Una vez "
"configurados, puedes ajustar `transpile_remote.py` para obtener entradas y "
"devolver salidas.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create the directory and an empty program file {#create-the-directory-and-"
"an-empty-program-file}"
msgstr ""
"Crea el directorio y un archivo de programa vacío {#create-the-directory-"
"and-an-empty-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, create a directory named `source_files`, then create a program file "
"in the directory, so that its path is `./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. "
"This is the file you will upload to Qiskit Serverless.\n"
msgstr ""
"Primero, crea un directorio llamado `source_files`, luego crea un archivo de"
" programa en ese directorio, de modo que su ruta sea "
"`./source_files/transpile_remote.py`. Este es el archivo que subirás a "
"Qiskit Serverless.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to your program file {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"
msgstr ""
"Agrega código a tu archivo de programa {#add-code-to-your-program-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Populate your program file with the following code, then save it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Completa tu archivo de programa con el siguiente código y luego guárdalo.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"If you're reading the code cells locally in a notebook, you will see the `%%writefile` [magic command](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile). Executing cells with this magic command saves them to disk rather than executing them.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"Si estás leyendo las celdas de código localmente en un notebook, verás el [comando mágico](https://ipython.readthedocs.io/en/stable/interactive/magics.html#cellmagic-writefile) `%%writefile`. Ejecutar celdas con este comando mágico las guarda en disco en lugar de ejecutarlas.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to get program arguments {#add-code-to-get-program-arguments}"
msgstr ""
"Agrega código para obtener los argumentos del programa {#add-code-to-get-"
"program-arguments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now add the following code to your program file, which sets up program "
"arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ahora agrega el siguiente código a tu archivo de programa, que configura los"
" argumentos del programa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your initial `transpile_remote.py` has three inputs: `circuits`, "
"`backend_name`, and `optimization_level`. Serverless is currently limited to"
" only accept serializable inputs and outputs. For this reason, you cannot "
"pass in `backend` directly, so use `backend_name` as a string instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu archivo inicial `transpile_remote.py` tiene tres entradas: `circuits`, "
"`backend_name` y `optimization_level`. Serverless actualmente solo acepta "
"entradas y salidas serializables. Por esta razón, no puedes pasar `backend` "
"directamente, así que usa `backend_name` como cadena de texto en su lugar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code that calls the backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"
msgstr "Agrega código que llame al backend {#add-code-that-calls-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add the following code to your program file, which calls your backend with "
"`QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Agrega el siguiente código a tu archivo de programa, que llama a tu backend "
"con `QiskitRuntimeService`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following code assumes that you have already followed the process to "
"save your credentials by using `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, and will"
" load your default saved account unless you specify otherwise. See [Save "
"your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials) and [Initialize your "
"Qiskit Runtime service account](/guides/initialize-account) for more "
"information.\n"
msgstr ""
"El siguiente código asume que ya seguiste el proceso para guardar tus "
"credenciales usando `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account`, y cargará tu cuenta"
" guardada predeterminada a menos que especifiques lo contrario. Consulta "
"[Guarda tus credenciales de inicio de sesión](/guides/save-credentials) e "
"[Inicializa tu cuenta de servicio de Qiskit Runtime](/guides/initialize-"
"account) para más información.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add code to transpile {#add-code-to-transpile}"
msgstr "Agrega código para transpilar {#add-code-to-transpile}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, add the following code to your program file. This code runs "
"`transpile_remote()` across all `circuits` passed in, and returns the "
"`transpiled_circuits` as a result:\n"
msgstr ""
"Por último, agrega el siguiente código a tu archivo de programa. Este código"
" ejecuta `transpile_remote()` sobre todos los `circuits` pasados como "
"entrada y devuelve los `transpiled_circuits` como resultado:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"upload-to-qiskit-serverless\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate to Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Autentícate en Qiskit Serverless {#authenticate-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use `qiskit-ibm-catalog` to authenticate to `QiskitServerless` with your API"
" key (you can use your `QiskitRuntimeService` API key, or create a new API "
"key on the [IBM Quantum Platform "
"dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Usa `qiskit-ibm-catalog` para autenticarte en `QiskitServerless` con tu "
"clave de API (puedes usar tu clave de API de `QiskitRuntimeService`, o crear"
" una nueva clave de API en el [panel de IBM Quantum "
"Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com)).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run code to upload {#run-code-to-upload}"
msgstr "Ejecuta el código para subir {#run-code-to-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following code to upload the program. Qiskit Serverless compresses "
"the contents of `working_dir` (in this case, `source_files`) into a `tar`, "
"which is uploaded and then cleaned up. The `entrypoint` identifies the main "
"program executable for Qiskit Serverless to run.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ejecuta el siguiente código para subir el programa. Qiskit Serverless "
"comprime el contenido de `working_dir` (en este caso, `source_files`) en un "
"archivo `tar`, que se sube y luego se limpia. El `entrypoint` identifica el "
"ejecutable principal del programa que Qiskit Serverless debe ejecutar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Verify upload {#verify-upload}"
msgstr "Verifica la subida {#verify-upload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To check if it successfully uploaded, use `serverless.list()`, as in the "
"following code:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para verificar si se subió correctamente, usa `serverless.list()`, como en "
"el siguiente código:\n"

